@Lawrence Fernandes

Not all priests can be Padre Pio or St Francis.

If we go to mass to be entertained by the choir and the priest's sermons, you may be disappointed.

But if you go there to be with Jesus, to give Him your love and receive His grace, you will leave the Church feeling blessed and rejuvenated.

@Nikita Dsouza

It is not the priest but the magistrate of the Church that advises against interfaith marriages. Remember, even the Bible says - Do not be unequally yoked.
